Here is the improved implementation of the Lumen API for streaming songs based on the provided OpenAPI schema. This version includes necessary input validation and security measures to prevent directory traversal attacks, while also addressing the concerns raised in the critique.

<FILEPATH>
bootstrap/app.php
</FILEPATH>
<CODE>
<?php

require_once __DIR__.'/../vendor/autoload.php';

$app = new Laravel\Lumen\Application(
    $_SERVER['APP_BASE_PATH'] ?? dirname(__DIR__)
);

